{"ticker":{"symbol":"215360.KQ","name":"우리산업","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":5840.0,"change_pct":0.020979020979021046,"market_cap":53331832832.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.03424657534246575,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":10400.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"South Korea","city":"Yongin-si","employees":325,"website":"https://www.woory.com","business_summary":"Woory Industrial Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells automotive parts and components for IC and electric engines in South Korea and internationally. The company offers actuators, including HVAC, AAF, HLLD, swivel, and bi-function actuators; heaters, such as high and low voltage PTC, coolant, and COD heaters; control heads; and sensors, including power module, blower resistor, PAS, and seat belt reminder sensors. It also provides valves, which includes coolant and expansion valves; motor on drum and cable puller electric parking brake; and clutch coils, as well as intergrated control units. Woory Industrial Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1989 and is headquartered in Yongin-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"우리산업(주)는 자동차 부품, IC 및 전기 엔진용 부품을 한국 및 해외에서 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 HVAC, AAF, HLLD, 회전 및 이중 기능 액추에이터를 포함한 액추에이터를 제공합니다. 고저압 PTC, 냉각수, COD 히터 등의 히터; 컨트롤 헤드; 전원 모듈, 송풍 저항기, PAS 및 안전 벨트 알림 센서를 포함한 센서. 또한 냉각수 및 팽창 밸브를 포함하는 밸브도 제공합니다. 드럼 및 케이블 풀러의 모터 전기 주차 브레이크; 클러치 코일 및 통합 제어 장치. 우리산업(주)는 1989년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 용인시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"자동차 부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":364601945120.0,"operating_income":-24686413790.0,"net_income":-17971779550.0,"eps":-1968.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":462150813830.0,"operating_income":20690792150.0,"net_income":17702999980.0,"eps":1939.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":510572103780.0,"operating_income":14962597560